nformation\n\nGodot v4.6.stable unknown - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Sat, 24 Jan 2026 00:47:39 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon 890M Graphics (RADV GFX1150) - AMD Ryzen AI 9 HX 370 w/ Radeon 890M (24 threads) - 23.07 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen `interface/editor/font_antialiasing` is set to LCD Subpixel, the scrollbars in the script editor become invisible. They become visible when the caret is at the last line/row, but then they also blink with the caret. But it doesn't if the last line has a tab and nothing else in it...\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c52d0c35-5c2d-40d5-9c06-f8e57390a3ff\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Set `interface/editor/font_antialiasing` to LCD Subpixel.\n2. Open a script.\n3. Require scrollbars (e.g. make the window very small, add a long line, add many lines etc.)\n4. Make sure the last line is not just tabs. Fully empty line works for repro.\n5. If caret is at the last line: Observe that the scrollbars blink with the caret.\n6. If caret is not at the last line: Observe that the scrollbars don't show.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github